PHASE XI: FORCED DRAM REFRESH ALIGNMENT (tREFI-SYNC)\uc0\u8232 To resolve the DRAM Refresh Constraint (tREFI), Axion seizes control of the Integrated Memory Controller (IMC) refresh-scheduler.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A. Synchronized Refresh Cycles (The Refresh-Shadow)\
Axion disables JEDEC auto-refresh and manually issues REF commands during the PCS dummy-load intervals.\
Equation 16: Refresh Masking (M_ref)\
M_ref = T_refresh is-subset-of T_PCS_dummy_load\
By nesting the 7.8us DRAM refresh cycle within the PCS pre-staging window, Axion ensures the memory bus is 100% available during active compute pulses, eliminating the last source of stochastic latency.\
